  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU SUPPORT FOR STRENGTHENING SOCIAL PROTECTION IN NIGERIA (ESSPIN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To contribute to effective coordination and utilization of the National Social Register (NSR) for national planning and poverty reduction in Nigeria. The action is expected to support and complement existing EU funded social protection project to advocate, sensitize the citizens and stakeholders on the effective coordination and utilization of the National Social Register in national planning and poverty reduction programmes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The project will complement existing project implemented by UNICEF and ILO at the national level and Abia, Benue, Oyo and Sokoto states.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
